# user secrets — NEVER ship
# Burp exports of the owner's own banking traffic. `captures*.xml` does not cover
# the flow-named ones (cancel-grossary.xml, delete-order.xml), and those are read
# by tests/test_grocery_cancel.py and tests/test_booking_and_ranking.py, so they
# are the ones most likely to get copied into the repo by hand.
captures.xml
captures2.xml
captures*.xml
captures.jsonl
refresh_captures.xml
refresh_captures.jsonl
cancel-grossary.xml
delete-order.xml
*-grossary.xml
session.json
*.har

# Runtime logs. They live in ~/.local/share/tbank-mcp/ by default, but
# TBANK_TRACE_FILE / TBANK_EVENTS / TBANK_ATTEMPTS relocate them anywhere —
# including here. calls.jsonl carries tool arguments, attempts.jsonl carries
# checkout bodies.
calls.jsonl
events.jsonl
attempts.jsonl
*.jsonl.1

# reverse-engineering artifacts (large, not part of the MCP runtime)
tbank_app.apk
*.objection.apk*
dex/
jadx-out*/
extracted/
tools/
dev/
redroid-data/

# regenerated at runtime by tbank_mcp/tls.py
ca/bundle.pem

# python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/

# misc
*.log
.DS_Store

# CA certs regenerated/derivable at runtime
ca/*.pem
ca/*.cer

# ca/roots/ is the OPPOSITE: public root certificates, committed on purpose and
# pinned by SHA-256 in src/tls.py. Do not add it to the ignores above — without it
# 13 of the 18 bank hosts fail to verify.
!ca/roots/
